  "contentHtml": "<p>에너지 전환과 보존 단원은 문제만 풀면 재미가 없어서요.. 고민하다가 잠깐 환기하는 시간으로 리듬게임 챌린지를 변형해보았습니다.</p><p>먼저.. 6단원 에너지전환과 보존에서 물어볼 수 있는 건 6가지라고 소개를 하고 하나씩 맞춰봅니다.</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/4dd4dc9e6c5b936d939970d9f987af2f70728944\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/4dd4dc9e6c5b936d939970d9f987af2f70728944\" data-origin-width=\"960\" data-origin-height=\"540\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/dfe46fde1d5ee6bffe08cb028cbfb2146c4652d3\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/dfe46fde1d5ee6bffe08cb028cbfb2146c4652d3\" data-origin-width=\"960\" data-origin-height=\"540\"></div><p>그 다음에 초등학교에서 하는 리듬게임을 같이 해봅니다.</p><p><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=arP4MALsLns\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"ke-link\">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=arP4MALsLns</a></p><div class=\"figure-video\" data-ke-type=\"video\" data-video-url=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=arP4MALsLns\" data-video-host=\"youtube\" data-video-play-service=\"daum_cafe\" data-video-width=\"868\" data-video-height=\"488\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-video-thumbnail=\"https://scrap.kakaocdn.net/dn/8mvcp/dJMb86PkMt3/nVz1fxbVLmXNLZKbfcZXc1/img.jpg?width=1280&amp;height=720&amp;face=0_0_1280_720,https://scrap.kakaocdn.net/dn/1Pksy/dJMb8Yqer8Q/j9bgubDemrcx8kVKXLekEk/img.jpg?width=1280&amp;height=720&amp;face=0_0_1280_720,https://scrap.kakaocdn.net/dn/jqwDn/dJMb87Of6Rg/IpZK7CP6NR7yju9Ktjek9k/img.jpg?width=1280&amp;height=720&amp;face=0_0_1280_720\" data-ke-mobile-mobilestyle=\"widthContent\" data-video-origin-width=\"868\" data-video-origin-height=\"488\"><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/arP4MALsLns\" width=\"868\" height=\"488\" frameborder=\"0\" scrolling=\"no\" allowfullscreen=\"\"></iframe><div class=\"figcaption\"></div></div><p>난이도를 높여서 하나를 더 해봅니다. (이건 글자가 안 나와서 좀 어렵습니다.)</p><p><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=_RiQjsu1KIw\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"ke-link\">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=_RiQjsu1KIw</a></p><div class=\"figure-video\" data-ke-type=\"video\" data-video-url=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=_RiQjsu1KIw\" data-video-host=\"youtube\" data-video-play-service=\"daum_cafe\" data-video-width=\"853\" data-video-height=\"480\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-video-thumbnail=\"https://scrap.kakaocdn.net/dn/bo8SWB/dJMb9gxEogl/qdBCAkUxgRhMF5FYqZ5v80/img.jpg?width=1280&amp;height=720&amp;face=0_0_1280_720,https://scrap.kakaocdn.net/dn/bilfkX/dJMb9jOFIs2/f2H2Po72NXWZkdGtKX2VZ0/img.jpg?width=1280&amp;height=720&amp;face=0_0_1280_720\" data-ke-mobile-mobilestyle=\"widthContent\" data-video-origin-width=\"853\" data-video-origin-height=\"480\"><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/_RiQjsu1KIw\" width=\"853\" height=\"480\" frameborder=\"0\" scrolling=\"no\" allowfullscreen=\"\"></iframe><div class=\"figcaption\"></div></div><p>정말 재밌고 신나게 합니다...ㅎㅎ 반 분위기에 따라 다르지만 한 명만 도전해도 재밌어요ㅋㅋㅋ</p><p>&#160;</p><p>그 다음 이 게임을 왜 했냐면 바로 우리가 과학 용어를 좀 더 재밌게 접근해보자는 의미였다고 하면서</p><p>아래 ppt 4장을 보여주면서 이 4장의 ppt가 의미하는게 뭘까? 물어보면.. 게임으로 신난 아이들의 집중도가 올라가면서</p><p style=\"text-align: start;\">위치에너지를 구하려면 질량과 높이가 필요하고.. 거기에 디테일하게는 9.8을 곱해야하고 등등 이야기를 할 수 있습니다.</p><p>&#160;</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/c6cb875662e6a52ecc5f358bf5ef445d8c498694\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/c6cb875662e6a52ecc5f358bf5ef445d8c498694\" data-origin-width=\"960\" data-origin-height=\"540\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/07c43d84aa6d556355da2467d9f9ea8a3a171df5\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/07c43d84aa6d556355da2467d9f9ea8a3a171df5\" data-origin-width=\"960\" data-origin-height=\"540\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/170a91d9c253be05902c314df5834cb1dfb12a35\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/170a91d9c253be05902c314df5834cb1dfb12a35\" data-origin-width=\"960\" data-origin-height=\"540\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/b8f5d6d0d130d4335f273f5014a7a895edf4a0a5\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/b8f5d6d0d130d4335f273f5014a7a895edf4a0a5\" data-origin-width=\"960\" data-origin-height=\"540\"></div><p>그리고 나서 두 번째 영상을 bgm으로 틀어준 다음에&#160;ppt로 4장 차례차례 넘기면서 리듬게임을 해봤어요.</p><p>웃으면서 꽤 잘 따라합니다. 그리고 이제 문제풀이 시간으로 들어갔습니다..</p><p>그냥 문제를 푸는 것보다는 덜 지루한 것 같아서 올려봅니다.</p><div class=\"figure-file\" data-ke-type=\"file\" data-file-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/cb7c7ca86de11cc9c52e5c941e6530d3bda4cf27?download\" data-file-name=\"에너지전환과보존 리듬 게임.pptx\" data-file-size=\"4767095\" data-mimetype=\"application/vnd.openxmlformats-officedocument.presentationml.presentation\" data-ke-align=\"alignCenter\"><a href=\"javascript:checkVirus('grpid%3D1TaBA%26fldid%3DfMHp%26dataid%3D1560%26fileid%3D8%26regdt%3D20260904144344&url=https%3A%2F%2Ft1.daumcdn.net%2Fcafeattach%2F1TaBA%2Fcb7c7ca86de11cc9c52e5c941e6530d3bda4cf27')\"><div class=\"image\"></div><div class=\"desc\"><div class=\"filename\"><span class=\"name\">에너지전환과보존 리듬 게임</span><span class=\"type\">.pptx</span></div><div class=\"size\">4.55MB</div></div></a></div>\n\t \t\t\t\t\t<!-- -->",
